{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_028ari0234_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_028ari0234_1000_p", "source_sha256": "153e5e51bbb1f1b72a965a8374a645840e3b3d87a7ab41a303a00c645e51d940", "ja": "亜利沙、そろそろ衣装チェックを……\nあ、あれ？", "zh": "亚利沙，差不多该检查服装了……\n啊，咦？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_028ari0234_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_028ari0234_1001_028ari", "source_sha256": "da38c4b28c0dc01812eb04f017ca371c0d8a8a126431f82da8731e215a452a5f", "ja": "ひゃっ！？　{$P$}さん！！\nま、まだ見ちゃダメですよぉ！", "zh": "呀！？{$P$}先生！！\n还、还不能看啦！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_028ari0234_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_028ari0234_1002_p", "source_sha256": "c2240a26dce73c8590d909db634a8c9bc600f745636655896ded37d395084a49", "ja": "あっ、まだ着替え中だったか！？\nゴメン、すぐ出てくから！", "zh": "啊，原来你还在换衣服啊！？\n抱歉，我马上出去！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_028ari0234_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_028ari0234_1003_028ari", "source_sha256": "9da5e9396beb657f0a3aebacf86ea46dd0258779d58c8c8bf7b4e8cb8d8a8b84", "ja": "いえ、着替えはとっくに終わってますから\n平気なんですケド……心の準備がですね……。", "zh": "不是，我早就换好衣服了，\n倒是没关系……只是心理准备还没做好……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_028ari0234_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_028ari0234_1004_p", "source_sha256": "83e717c55b85cd6c9362d577a0d09ffca87b601453f9545cd7d0eb4ae5604272", "ja": "ああ、そういう……。\nじゃあ、少し待とうか。", "zh": "啊，原来是这样……  \n那就稍微等一会儿吧。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_028ari0234_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_028ari0234_1005_028ari", "source_sha256": "a96628d4dd497be560864d9f1242371f51f8cace7ce91d77060d13e77d460189", "ja": "5秒ください、5秒で行けます。4、3……。\nふぅ。……ううっ。", "zh": "请给我5秒钟，5秒钟就能搞定。4、3……。\n呼。……呜呜。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_028ari0234_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_028ari0234_1006_p", "source_sha256": "c77e42d2b1b55a0ef8981887f45a57eec7260407c20e38b6eacff0e993d3d587", "ja": "5秒にしてはだいぶ長いけど……。\n試着なのに、そんなに緊張するのか？", "zh": "这5秒可够久的了……\n只是试穿而已，用得着这么紧张吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_028ari0234_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_028ari0234_1007_028ari", "source_sha256": "6b7a62be2e5b2a9d5db7f8f7b64e293fc5a3c2456a25b6f723cf752c2b0c6be6", "ja": "そ、それはそうです。なぜならこの衣装、まさしく\n王道の正統派、どんな言い訳もごまかしもナシ……。", "zh": "那、那是当然的。因为这套服装，正是\n王道的正统派，任何借口和掩饰都不管用……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_028ari0234_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_028ari0234_1008_028ari", "source_sha256": "f61f8479e709d142eac1bd0b4e809af2906d8b843a2886cfa12252860d83289a", "ja": "この衣装、カワイイが過ぎますよぉ！\n半端な覚悟では着られませんっ！", "zh": "这套服装也太可爱了吧！\n没有足够的觉悟可穿不来啊！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_028ari0234_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_028ari0234_1009_p", "source_sha256": "2d092411b004188992faeff2b935df238787dc83906696d0574283775192f8a0", "ja": "いや、でももう着てるし……。\nちゃんと似合ってるから、大丈夫だぞ。", "zh": "话是这么说，但你已经穿上了啊……\n而且很适合你，没问题的。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_028ari0234_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_028ari0234_1010_028ari", "source_sha256": "f38e290c02375c1ea33af5dc87c42d7ab2f7dd89462adf817be689f754c4738c", "ja": "ああっ！　た、確かに……そうです。\nありさはもう、着てしまいました……。", "zh": "啊！确、确实……是这样。亚利沙已经穿上了……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_028ari0234_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_028ari0234_1011_028ari", "source_sha256": "b00e3d09459d74b6f40afbe920d26986fa099d9779c377849a1499d88e45dbfb", "ja": "{$P$}さんに、似合うと言われて\n今、ものすごく感激していますが……。", "zh": "能被{$P$}先生夸奖很合适，\n我现在超级感动的，但是……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_028ari0234_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_028ari0234_1012_028ari", "source_sha256": "77bbb30391d430c22495c58fb9e4a68a40cb23416e300ee38afc3462c98b4c8f", "ja": "ですがやっぱり、正統派アイドルちゃん衣装は、\nさすがにプレッシャーがあるというか……！", "zh": "不过说到底，穿上正统派偶像的服装，果然还是有点压力……！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_028ari0234_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_028ari0234_1013_p", "source_sha256": "45905127e5bdb7d967de9063d04d422089bda68dcf9974f155de1e0ce53e7db6", "ja": "正統派か……。正統派とかそうじゃないとか、\nどういう基準なんだろうな。結構言われるけど。", "zh": "正统派啊……所谓正统派还是非正统派，到底是以什么为标准呢？虽然经常有人这么说。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_028ari0234_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_028ari0234_1014_028ari", "source_sha256": "4f9bf3f1199410cfda533a6e4055716cf7d8dff95f5b7416a17c538689455968", "ja": "えっ、それは……活躍する場所とか音楽のジャンルとか\nアイドル路線の分類は、色々あると思いますケド……。", "zh": "诶，这个嘛……我觉得，无论是活跃的场所、音乐类型，还是偶像路线的分类，都有很多种吧……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_028ari0234_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_028ari0234_1015_028ari", "source_sha256": "882f0a1160e8b80ed753dc8959280c3ebf79a75cbecfa797aadaf8d2115fbe45", "ja": "でも路線そのものより、そこに乗ったアイドルちゃん\n本人が、どれだけ輝けるかが大事かと……！", "zh": "不过，比起路线本身，我觉得走上这条路线的偶像本人能绽放出多耀眼的光芒，才更重要……！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_028ari0234_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_028ari0234_1016_p", "source_sha256": "546f56734a4c5d3be57a0ebee3d44a6ea5825091006bb192c271addaa765da72", "ja": "ああ、俺もそう思う！　それで亜利沙は、\n最初にその衣装を見た時、輝いて見えたか？", "zh": "啊，我也这么觉得！那么，亚利沙在第一次看到那套服装时，觉得它很耀眼吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_028ari0234_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_028ari0234_1017_028ari", "source_sha256": "bc096d513963a12c5f452cc59c5c7cf75c187dd98482a98d619455c66a7b17cf", "ja": "もちろんですよぉ！\n最高の衣装だと思います！！　はあぁ……♪", "zh": "当然啦！\n我觉得这是最棒的服装！！哈啊……♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_028ari0234_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_028ari0234_1018_p", "source_sha256": "fd3fbb900cb101027f88a2c4f0676fed4f996b0672a2c07593ea2314db70d734", "ja": "よかった。なら正統派とかは気にしないで\n着て欲しいな。それは亜利沙の衣装なんだから。", "zh": "太好了。那就别在意什么正统派不正统派的，穿上它吧。毕竟那是属于亚利沙的服装。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_028ari0234_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_028ari0234_1019_028ari", "source_sha256": "055fc7de80fedcc5948e7cdbc98e5a1c53ad1993eb06d7c252bedaae9d616a6b", "ja": "はっ！？　そ、そうですよね……。\nアイドルちゃんは、ジャンルではありません！", "zh": "哈！？对、对哦……。\n偶像女孩可不是一种类型！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_028ari0234_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_028ari0234_1020_028ari", "source_sha256": "91633745f972ea703bee94a914542f38e42fb837e638bb3d98150a5779d3d4e8", "ja": "この衣装、大事にします！\n今はまだ、着こなせないかもですケド……。", "zh": "我会好好珍惜这套服装的！\n不过现在可能还驾驭不好……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_028ari0234_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_028ari0234_1021_028ari", "source_sha256": "8a15f9d2cb09ecee9a4c8aba932257951b72b702297ae1858628fabc23c6ca97", "ja": "いつか絶対、ありさなりの着こなしでステージに\n立てるよう……頑張りますよぉっ！！", "zh": "总有一天，亚利沙绝对会以自己的风格穿上它\n站上舞台……我会加油的哦！！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_028ari0234_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_028ari0234_1022_p", "source_sha256": "521e01cfabb6a9c8c2dd89d961476a97e38c33991a153521dd75a559e086eddf", "ja": "（いつか亜利沙は、新しい時代の正統派アイドルに\nなってくれるかもしれない……期待しよう！）", "zh": "（有朝一日，亚利沙或许会成为引领新时代的正统派偶像……期待一下吧！）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
